<title>USA: Tellabs approves 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Tellabs approves 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Thursday its board approved a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend payable November 15, record October 31.</p>
<p>After the split, there will be about 179 milion common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Tellabs designs and manufactures voice and data transport and network access systems.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
